        "quote": "The Transportation Operations Division shall be under the supervision and jurisdiction of the Public Works Director. The principal officer of the Division shall be the Transportation Operations Superintendent under direction of the Director of Public Works. The Division of Transportation Operations shall consist of such other employees in addition to the Superintendent as are necessary for the operation of the Division.",
